{
  "about": "The ad blocker's filter lists and resources, for every Eden browser (the desktop browser's app/adblock.js reads it; Eden Apollo's port reuses it). It matches Brave Shields' default (brave/adblock-resources filter_lists/list_catalog.json, checked 2026-11-13: 'Brave Default Adblock Filters', 'Brave Default Privacy Filters', 'Brave First Party Adblock Filters', 'Cookie notice blocker', 'Mobile app promo blocker', all on by default), plus three lists Brave leaves off that we keep. Lists are fetched from their publishers at run time, never shipped with the app. 'platforms' says which browsers load a list; 'brave' names the Brave default it matches (null: ours only); 'blockPages' lists may stop a page from opening at all (malware and scam sites), as Brave's domain block does.",
